                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Clinical PICO:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " In prostate cancer patients undergoing VMAT (P), does a standardized hydration protocol (I) compared to standard verbal instructions (C) improve daily CBCT bladder volume consistency (O)?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Non-clinical PICO:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " In undergraduate radiation therapy students (P), does VR-based training (I), compared to traditional 2D didactic lectures (C), improve spatial anatomy recognition and clinical setup accuracy (O)?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "knowledge_check",
            "key": "lq_page3_1",
            "stem": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In the clinical PICO question above, what is the \"C\" (Comparison)?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": [
              "Standard verbal instructions",
              "Bladder volume consistency"
            ],
            "answer": 0,
            "explanation": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The comparison is the current standard practice the intervention is being measured against \u2014 here, verbal instructions."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Searching the Literature",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Once your PICO question is set, find out what's already known. Databases like PubMed, CINAHL, and ERIC (for educational research) rely heavily on Boolean operators to narrow or broaden a search:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "AND",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " \u2014 narrows the search; both terms must be present (e.g., "
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "radiotherapy education AND virtual reality",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "italic"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ")"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "OR",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " \u2014 broadens the search; either term qualifies, useful for synonyms (e.g., "
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "simulation OR VR training",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "italic"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ")"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "NOT",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " \u2014 excludes terms (e.g., "
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "prostate cancer NOT brachytherapy",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "italic"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ")"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Screening What You Find",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "callout",
                  "attrs": {
                    "kind": "key-principle"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "When screening search results, read the "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Abstract",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "bold"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " first \u2014 specifically the Objective and Conclusion \u2014 to quickly judge whether an article actually fits your PICO parameters before reading the whole thing."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Favor peer-reviewed articles published within the last 5\u20137 years to keep your evidence current, unless you have a specific reason to cite older foundational work."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "knowledge_check",
            "key": "lq_page5_1",
            "stem": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You want articles about VR training OR simulation training in radiologic education, but want to exclude anything about surgical simulation. Which search captures this?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": [
              "(VR training OR simulation training) AND radiologic education NOT surgical",
              "VR training AND simulation training AND radiologic education AND surgical"
            ],
            "answer": 0,
            "explanation": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "OR broadens between the two training terms, AND narrows to the right field, and NOT excludes the irrelevant surgical topic."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Is There Really a Gap?",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Sometimes a literature search reveals the question has already been thoroughly answered \u2014 that's a useful finding too, and it means either refining your question further or picking a genuinely open angle. A real gap in the literature is a question current research hasn't yet resolved, not just a topic that happens to interest you."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Wrap-Up",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You've covered writing a problem statement, building a PICO question, using Boolean search operators, and screening literature efficiently."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Next: once you know what's already been studied, you need to choose the research design that will actually let you answer your specific question."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
